{"slug":"zz-l-m","ar":"ظ ل م","total":315,"core":"wrongdoing; injustice; darkness","forms":[{"ar":"ظَالِم","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":129,"gloss":"Wrongdoer, unjust","word":"zalim","ex":{"s":26,"a":209,"p":4,"ar":["ذِكْرَىٰ","وَمَا","كُنَّا","ظَـٰلِمِينَ"],"en":"As a reminder; and never have We been unjust"}},{"ar":"ظَلَمَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":110,"gloss":"to wrong","word":null,"ex":{"s":43,"a":76,"p":2,"ar":["وَمَا","ظَلَمْنَـٰهُمْ","وَلَـٰكِن","كَانُوا۟","هُمُ","ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ"],"en":"And We did not wrong them, but it was they who were the wrongdoers"}},{"ar":"ظُلُمَٰت","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":23,"gloss":"darkness","word":null,"ex":{"s":35,"a":20,"p":2,"ar":["وَلَا","ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتُ","وَلَا","ٱلنُّورُ"],"en":"Nor are the darknesses and the light"}},{"ar":"ظُلْم","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":20,"gloss":"Injustice","word":"az-zulm","ex":{"s":11,"a":117,"p":6,"ar":["وَمَا","كَانَ","رَبُّكَ","لِيُهْلِكَ","ٱلْقُرَىٰ","بِظُلْمٍ","وَأَهْلُهَا","مُصْلِحُونَ"],"en":"And your Lord would not have destroyed the cities unjustly while their people were reformers"}},{"ar":"أَظْلَم","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":16,"gloss":"more unjust","word":null,"ex":{"s":53,"a":52,"p":8,"ar":["وَقَوْمَ","نُوحٍ","مِّن","قَبْلُ ۖ","إِنَّهُمْ","كَانُوا۟","هُمْ","أَظْلَمَ","وَأَطْغَىٰ"],"en":"And the people of Noah before. Indeed, it was they who were [even] more unjust and oppressing"}},{"ar":"ظَلَّٰم","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":5,"gloss":"unjust","word":null,"ex":{"s":50,"a":29,"p":7,"ar":["مَا","يُبَدَّلُ","ٱلْقَوْلُ","لَدَىَّ","وَمَآ","أَنَا۠","بِظَلَّـٰمٍ","لِّلْعَبِيدِ"],"en":"The word will not be changed with Me, and never will I be unjust to the servants"}},{"ar":"ظَالِمَة","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"unjust, wrongdoing","word":null,"ex":{"s":21,"a":11,"p":6,"ar":["وَكَمْ","قَصَمْنَا","مِن","قَرْيَةٍ","كَانَتْ","ظَالِمَةً","وَأَنشَأْنَا","بَعْدَهَا","قَوْمًا","ءَاخَرِينَ"],"en":"And how many a city which was unjust have We shattered and produced after it another people"}},{"ar":"ظَالِمِىٓ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"wronging","word":null,"ex":{"s":16,"a":28,"p":4,"ar":["ٱلَّذِينَ","تَتَوَفَّىٰهُمُ","ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","ظَالِمِىٓ","أَنفُسِهِمْ ۖ","فَأَلْقَوُا۟","ٱلسَّلَمَ","مَا","كُنَّا","نَعْمَلُ","مِن","سُوٓءٍۭ ۚ","بَلَىٰٓ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","عَلِيمٌۢ","بِمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"en":"The ones whom the angels take in death [while] wronging themselves, and [who] then offer submission, [saying], \"We were not doing any evil.\" But, yes! Indeed, Allah is Knowing of what you used to do"}},{"ar":"ظَلُوم","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"unjust","word":null,"ex":{"s":14,"a":34,"p":14,"ar":["وَءَاتَىٰكُم","مِّن","كُلِّ","مَا","سَأَلْتُمُوهُ ۚ","وَإِن","تَعُدُّوا۟","نِعْمَتَ","ٱللَّهِ","لَا","تُحْصُوهَآ ۗ","إِنَّ","ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","لَظَلُومٌ","كَفَّارٌ"],"en":"And He gave you from all you asked of Him. And if you should count the favor of Allah, you could not enumerate them. Indeed, mankind is [generally] most unjust and ungrateful"}},{"ar":"مُظْلِم","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":2,"gloss":"in darkness","word":null,"ex":{"s":36,"a":37,"p":9,"ar":["وَءَايَةٌ","لَّهُمُ","ٱلَّيْلُ","نَسْلَخُ","مِنْهُ","ٱلنَّهَارَ","فَإِذَا","هُم","مُّظْلِمُونَ"],"en":"And a sign for them is the night. We remove from it [the light of] day, so they are [left] in darkness"}},{"ar":"أَظْلَمَ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":1,"gloss":"to grow dark","word":null,"ex":{"s":2,"a":20,"p":11,"ar":["يَكَادُ","ٱلْبَرْقُ","يَخْطَفُ","أَبْصَـٰرَهُمْ ۖ","كُلَّمَآ","أَضَآءَ","لَهُم","مَّشَوْا۟","فِيهِ","وَإِذَآ","أَظْلَمَ","عَلَيْهِمْ","قَامُوا۟ ۚ","وَلَوْ","شَآءَ","ٱللَّهُ","لَذَهَبَ","بِسَمْعِهِمْ","وَأَبْصَـٰرِهِمْ ۚ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","عَلَىٰ","كُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","قَدِيرٌ"],"en":"The lightning almost snatches away their sight. Every time it lights [the way] for them, they walk therein; but when darkness comes over them, they stand [still]. And if Allah had willed, He could have taken away their hearing and their sight. Indeed, Allah is over all things competent"}},{"ar":"مَظْلُوم","kind":"passive participle","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"wronged","word":null,"ex":{"s":17,"a":33,"p":11,"ar":["وَلَا","تَقْتُلُوا۟","ٱلنَّفْسَ","ٱلَّتِى","حَرَّمَ","ٱللَّهُ","إِلَّا","بِٱلْحَقِّ ۗ","وَمَن","قُتِلَ","مَظْلُومًا","فَقَدْ","جَعَلْنَا","لِوَلِيِّهِۦ","سُلْطَـٰنًا","فَلَا","يُسْرِف","فِّى","ٱلْقَتْلِ ۖ","إِنَّهُۥ","كَانَ","مَنصُورًا"],"en":"And do not kill the soul which Allah has forbidden, except by right. And whoever is killed unjustly - We have given his heir authority, but let him not exceed limits in [the matter of] taking life. Indeed, he has been supported [by the law]"}}],"surahs":[[2,31],[6,24],[7,17],[3,15],[4,14],[11,14],[10,12],[21,11],[16,10],[14,9],[18,9],[42,8],[5,7],[9,7],[22,7],[28,7],[29,7],[17,6],[23,6],[27,6],[39,6],[25,5],[8,4],[26,4],[30,4],[35,4],[40,4],[43,4],[12,3],[19,3],[24,3],[34,3],[37,3],[46,3],[13,2],[20,2],[31,2],[33,2],[36,2],[45,2],[61,2],[62,2],[65,2],[71,2],[15,1],[32,1],[38,1],[41,1],[49,1],[50,1],[51,1],[52,1],[53,1],[57,1],[59,1],[60,1],[66,1],[68,1],[76,1]]}